cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these skills, please cite them using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Climate Data Hub Skills: AI agent skills for climate and agricultural geospatial data"
abstract: >-
  A collection of AI agent skills (SKILL.md instruction sets) for geospatial data
  processing in agriculture and climate change research: climate and soil data
  download, datacube building, spatial and temporal aggregation, plotting, spatial
  crop modeling and CGIAR Climate Data Hub metadata authoring.
authors:
  - family-names: "Aguilar Ariza"
    given-names: "Andrés"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8179-9931"
    affiliation: "Alliance of Bioversity International and CIAT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CGIAR-Climate-Data-Hub/skills"
url: "https://cgiar-climate-data-hub.github.io/skills/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - agent skills
  - climate data
  - geospatial
  - datacube
  - SoilGrids
  - crop modeling
  - metadata
  - CGIAR
